    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87231" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεκ-φοιτάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go forth, be announced previously,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				69.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>anticipate</i> a statement, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ -φοιτῶν ἀλλ᾽ ἐν τῷ παρόντι
					ταμιευόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.294
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>go forth beyond,</i> c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				2.7.14
			</span></i>.</div>
